This plugin is a lightweight yet powerful date and time picker designed for popular form builder plugins.

== Description ==
This plugin is a lightweight yet powerful date and time picker designed for popular form builder plugins.

- This plugin will add new type of field under `Standrad Fields` as `Date Time`. 
- Simply drag `Date-Time` field into the form.
- You can also add custom date time format under `Date Time Field` tab.

== Installation ==

1. Upload and unzip `date-time-field-for-forms.zip` to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress

== Changelog ==

= 1.0.0 =
* Added a Date Time field for Gravity form
* Added an option to add custom date time format
